    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    gsl,
    progress,
    rlang,
    utils,
    methods,
    torch (>= 0.16.0),
    mniw
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Suggests: 
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    shrinkTVP,
    plotly
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: torch backend, for installation guide see https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/torch/vignettes/installation.html
